<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <script src="./support.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap">
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; background: #f7f4ec; }
    a { color: #17181c; text-decoration: none; } a:hover { color: #0f766e; text-decoration: underline; }
    .A { font-family: "Newsreader", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; color: #17181c; }
    .mono { font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
    .kick { font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0f766e; }
    .sect { font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #17181c; }
    .h-lead { font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin: 0; }
    .h-2 { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin: 0; }
    .std { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; color: #2b2d33; }
    .sm { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; color: #4a4d55; }
    .chip { font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .04em; padding: 3px 7px; border: 1px solid #c9c2ae; border-radius: 3px; color: #4a4d55; background: #fffdf7; }
    .ok { color: #0f766e; border-color: #0f766e; }
    .miss { color: #b45309; border-color: #b45309; }
    .hair { border-top: 1px solid #d9d3c3; }
    .navl { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; }
  </style>
</helmet>
<div class="A" style="width: 390px; min-height: 1900px; background: #f7f4ec; padding: 0 18px 32px 18px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 14px 0 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9d3c3;">
    <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17181c" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"></path></svg>
    <div class="mono" style="font-size: 11px; color: #4a4d55; letter-spacing: .04em;">13 set 2026 · faltam 4 dias</div>
    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17181c" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5"></path></svg>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 18px 0 14px 0;">
    <div style="font-size: 38px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.03em;">pt.newsroom<span style="color: #8a8d94; font-weight: 400;">.sgit.ai</span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; color: #4a4d55; text-align: center;">O ecossistema português de IA, mapeado por completo.</div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid #17181c; border-bottom: 3px double #17181c; overflow: hidden;">
    <a href="#" class="navl" style="color: #0f766e;">Eventos</a><a href="#" class="navl">Empresas</a><a href="#" class="navl">Protagonistas</a><a href="#" class="navl">Instituições</a><a href="#" class="navl">Políticas</a>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding: 22px 0 20px 0;">
    <div class="kick">Startup Summit Lisbon 2026 · Beato</div>
    <h1 class="h-lead">Uma tentativa de recorde que a agenda não menciona</h1>
    <p class="std">Dois órgãos portugueses dizem que uma maratona de pitches de 48 horas, candidata ao Guinness, decorre em paralelo à cimeira a 16 e 17 de setembro. A agenda do próprio evento, a quatro dias das portas, não a lista.</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <span class="chip ok">AICEP · 29 jul</span><span class="chip ok">Portugal Business News · 29 jul</span><span class="chip miss">agenda · não lista</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hair" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 18px 0;">
    <div class="kick">A lista mexe-se</div>
    <h2 class="h-2">Chegaram cinco nomes e saiu um</h2>
    <p class="sm">Entre 8 e 13 de setembro, a lista publicada de oradores passou de 60 para 64. Temos as duas cópias e os dois hashes.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hair" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 18px 0;">
    <div class="kick">Verificação</div>
    <h2 class="h-2">Dois nomes para três palcos</h2>
    <p class="sm">A agenda chama-lhes Unicorn Stage e Impact Stage. A página de resumo por IA chama-lhes Main Stage e Startup Stage.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border-top: 1px solid #17181c; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 16px 0 18px 0;">
    <div class="sect">O grafo</div>
    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">«AI or Die» <span class="mono" style="font-size: 11px; color: #0f766e;">parte de</span> Startup Summit Lisbon 2026, que <span class="mono" style="font-size: 11px; color: #0f766e;">decorre em</span> Unicorn Factory Lisboa.</p>
    <div style="background: #fffdf7; border: 1px solid #d9d3c3;">
      <svg width="100%" height="190" viewBox="0 0 354 190" style="display: block;">
        <g stroke="#c9c2ae" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"><path d="M177 95 L70 40"></path><path d="M177 95 L80 150"></path><path d="M177 95 L290 45"></path><path d="M177 95 L300 140"></path></g>
        <g font-family="IBM Plex Mono, Menlo, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#0f766e"><text x="110" y="60">parte de</text><text x="105" y="135">decorre em</text><text x="225" y="62">organizado por</text><text x="248" y="112">coberto por</text></g>
        <g><circle cx="177" cy="95" r="16" fill="#17181c"></circle><circle cx="70" cy="40" r="10" fill="#0f766e"></circle><circle cx="80" cy="150" r="10" fill="#a16207"></circle><circle cx="290" cy="45" r="10" fill="#7c5cbf"></circle><circle cx="300" cy="140" r="10" fill="#b45309"></circle></g>
        <g font-family="Newsreader, Georgia, serif" font-size="11" fill="#17181c"><text x="177" y="126" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">Startup Summit Lisbon 2026</text><text x="70" y="24" text-anchor="middle">AI or Die</text><text x="80" y="174" text-anchor="middle">Unicorn Factory Lisboa</text><text x="290" y="29" text-anchor="middle">StartUp Events</text><text x="346" y="164" text-anchor="end">AICEP Portugal Global</text></g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <a href="#" class="mono" style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .04em; color: #0f766e;">Abrir o grafo → 192 nós · 298 arestas</a>
  </div>

  <div style="border-top: 1px solid #17181c; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 16px 0 18px 0;">
    <div class="sect">Esta semana em Lisboa</div>
    <div class="hair" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0;"><span class="mono" style="font-size: 12px; min-width: 88px;">16 set 19:00</span><span class="sm" style="color: #17181c;">Welcome Drinks</span></div>
    <div class="hair" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0;"><span class="mono" style="font-size: 12px; min-width: 88px;">17 set 09:30</span><span class="sm" style="color: #17181c;">Opening Keynote · Unicorn Stage</span></div>
    <div class="hair" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0;"><span class="mono" style="font-size: 12px; min-width: 88px;">17 set 11:45</span><span class="sm" style="color: #17181c;">AI or Die · Unicorn Stage</span></div>
    <div class="hair" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0;"><span class="mono" style="font-size: 12px; min-width: 88px;">18 set 09:30</span><span class="sm" style="color: #17181c;">Portuguese Unicorn Conversation · Unicorn Stage</span></div>
    <div class="hair" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0;"><span class="mono" style="font-size: 12px; min-width: 88px;">18 set 10:10</span><span class="sm" style="color: #17181c;">What I Built With AI · Impact Stage</span></div>
  </div>

  <div style="border-top: 1px solid #17181c; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 16px 0 18px 0;">
    <div class="sect">O que diz a imprensa</div>
    <p class="sm">AICEP Portugal Global · Portugal Business News · ScaleUp Porto · StartupEvents.org · Startup Map Hub · Eventbrite · o guia do próprio evento. Sete páginas congeladas, com hash; uma excluída (404).</p>
  </div>

  <div style="background: #17181c; color: #f7f4ec; padding: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
    <div class="sect" style="color: #a7f3d0;">Para redações</div>
    <p class="sm" style="color: #f7f4ec;">Os agentes desta redação seguem políticas de comportamento publicadas.</p>
    <a href="#" class="mono" style="font-size: 11px; color: #a7f3d0;">Ler as políticas →</a>
  </div>

  <div style="border-top: 3px double #17181c; margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
    <div class="sect">Ficha técnica</div>
    <p class="sm">Editor de registo: Dinis Cruz. Pesquisa, redação e verificação: agentes. Publicação: build. Arquivo: git.</p>
    <p class="sm">Proteção de dados · responsável: Dinis Cruz · remoção incondicional.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</x-dc>
</body>
</html>
